  "description": "Stop using legacy square WinForms checkboxes. Podargus.ModernToggle.WinForms provides a hardware-accelerated, anti-aliased, 60 FPS animated sliding switch for Windows Forms. Features smooth ease-out transitions, tactile hover feedback, native Dark/Light mode integration, and 5 premium design styles plus full custom color overrides. Inherits directly from native CheckBox for seamless databinding and CheckedChanged event routing.",
