  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Launched ModernToggle featuring 60 FPS smooth sliding ease-out animation.\n\t\t\t- Native inheritance from CheckBox for complete databinding and event compatibility.\n\t\t\t- Integrated Podargus 2-Theme (Dark/Light) and 5-Style matrix plus Custom color overrides.\n\t\t\t- Anti-aliased pill rendering with high-DPI scaling and zero-flicker double buffering.",
